 "main_html": "<section class=\"mdgov-section\">\n<div id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_editmodepanel2\">\n<h1 class=\"mdgov-section__heading\">Community Electric Vehicle Supply Equipment Grant Program </h1>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1_label\" style=\"display:none\">Main_Content</div><div aria-labelledby=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1_label\" class=\"ms-rtestate-field\" id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1__ControlWrapper_RichHtmlField\" style=\"display:inline\"><p><strong style=\"font-size:12pt;\"><img alt=\"electric vehicle being charged\" src=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/CommunityEVSE/iStock-1354073731.jpg\" style=\"margin:5px;width:800px;height:450px;\"/></strong> </p><span><div><strong>Upcoming Webinar Announcement!</strong> Join the Maryland Energy Administration (MEA) on October 22nd from 11 AM-12 PM Eastern Time for a conversation on the funding opportunity for EV charging. Discover how the FY27 Community EVSE Grant Program could help you install Level 2 or 3 chargers in your community. Register here: <a href=\"https://umd.zoom.us/meeting/register/COe-Xg4LTBGBbtcRUx2-UA#/registration\" target=\"_blank\">https://umd.zoom.us/meeting/register/COe-Xg4LTBGBbtcRUx2-UA#/registration</a>.  </div><div><br/></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Fiscal Year 2027</span></p><p></p><div><strong>Program Purpose:</strong> The Maryland Energy Administration is pleased to announce the FY27 Community Electric Vehicle Supply Equipment (EVSE) Program to increase access to affordable and reliable electric vehicle (EV) charging networks and reduce transportation greenhouse gas emissions throughout Maryland, especially in overburdened communities.<br/></div><div><br/></div><div>Competitive grants are available for Level 2 or Level 3 Electric Vehicle Supply Equipment (EVSE) installations for the following project types: <br/></div><div><ol><li><strong>Multi-family Housing (MFH)</strong> means an apartment-style building with 5 or more units providing dedicated EV charging infrastructure for housing occupants and visitors. </li><li><strong>Curbside</strong> means providing EV charging infrastructure on public roadsides for use by street-parked vehicles. </li><li><strong>Parking Hub</strong> means dedicated EV charging infrastructure for visitors of public and private parking lots and garages. </li><li><strong>Workplace</strong> means providing dedicated EV charging infrastructure for employees and visitors to use for their personal vehicles at their workplace. </li><li><strong>Fleet</strong> means providing dedicated EV charging infrastructure for commercially used vehicles, industrial fleet vehicles or electric school buses. A fleet is considered to be three or more vehicles.<br/></li></ol></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Program Type</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">: Competitive Grant</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Target Audience</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">: Businesses, nonprofits, local governments, local education agencies, and certain higher education institutions.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Funding Opportunity Announcement Issue Date</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">: September 9, 2026</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Application Deadline: 3:00 PM Eastern Time,​ </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">December 9, 2026</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Anticipated Notification of Grant Award or Non-Award</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">: Spring 2027</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Online Application Submission: </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Through the My MEA portal at <a href=\"https://mea.maryland.gov/\" target=\"_blank\">https://mea.maryland.gov/</a> ​</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Online Application Portal Status: <strong>​​​</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Open to new applications</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Anticipated Program Budget</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">: MEA anticipates up to $16,500,000 will be available from the SEIF for grants awarded under this Program. The total amount awarded may be more or less, depending on the funding sources, the amount available and restrictions on each funding source, and the number and quality of applications received.​​</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#444444;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Program Documents:</span></p><ul dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/CommunityEVSE/FY27%20Community%20EVSE%20Grant%20Program%20FOA%20-%20Modified%2010.09.26.docx.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"ms-asset-icon ms-rtePosition-4\" src=\"/_layouts/15/images/icpdf.png\"/>FY27 Community EVSE Grant Program FOA - Modified 10.09.26</a><br/></li><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/all-incentives/Grant%20Agreement%20General%20Provisions%20Version%204%20for%20Fiscal%20Year%202027%20-%20Present.pdf\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-size:1rem;\" target=\"_blank\">Attachment A: MEA General Provisions</a></li><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/all-incentives/MEA%20Fossil%20Fuel%20Policy%20Version%201%20for%20Fiscal%20Year%202027%20-%20present.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Attachment B: MEA’s Fossil Fuel Policy <span style=\"font-size:1rem;\">​​</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/all-incentives/Self-Verification%20of%20Minimum%20Eligibility%20v2.pdf\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\" target=\"_blank\">Attachment C: Self-Verification of Minimum Eligibility</a><br/></li><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/CommunityEVSE/Attachment%20D%20-%20Project%20and%20Budget%20Workbook%209.3.26.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Attachment D - Project and Budget Workbook 9.3.26</a><br/></li></ul><div><br/></div><div><strong>Webinars:</strong></div><div><ul><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/CommunityEVSE/FY27%20C-EVSE%20Webinar_10_06_2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"ms-asset-icon ms-rtePosition-4\" src=\"/_layouts/15/images/icpdf.png\"/>FY27 C-EVSE Webinar 10.06.2026</a><br/></li><li><div class=\"ms-rtestate-read ms-rte-embedcode ms-rtestate-notify ms-rte-embedil\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BkNXAus6yDc?si=T_0ogJx1qGJtbE28\" title=\"YouTube video player\" width=\"560\"></iframe> </div><br/></li></ul></div><div><br/></div></span><div><span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.94962;margin:0pt 5.18707pt 0pt 0.648003pt;text-indent:0.815994pt;\"><strong>FY26 Award List:</strong> <a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/CommunityEVSE/FY26%20Community%20EVSE%20Award%20List.docx.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"ms-asset-icon ms-rtePosition-4\" src=\"/_layouts/15/images/icpdf.png\"/>FY26 Community EVSE Award List</a>​<br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.94962;margin:0pt 5.18707pt 0pt 0.648003pt;text-indent:0.815994pt;\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.94962;margin:0pt 5.18707pt 0pt 0.648003pt;text-indent:0.815994pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;vertical-align:baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;text-indent:1.08799px;\">FY25 Quarterly Progress Reporting Requirement:</span>​</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.94962;margin:0pt 5.18707pt 0pt 0.648003pt;text-indent:0.815994pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:1rem;\">All FY25 Community EVSE Program grantees must submit Quarterly Progress Reports. These reports provide regular project updates and serve as the mechanism for submitting reimbursement requests.</span></p><div><br/></div><div>Grantees must complete and submit reports using the <a href=\"https://form.jotform.com/mdenergy/QPR-for-FY25-Community-EVSE-grantee\" target=\"_blank\">JotForm Quarterly Progress Report Form for the FY25 Community EVSE Program</a>. </div><div><br/></div><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Program Contacts</strong></div><div>Please direct all inquiries to <a href=\"mailto:transportation.mea@maryland.gov\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"5622243738252639242237223f3938783b3337163b37242f3a37383278313920\">[email protected]</span></a></div><div><ul><li><strong>FY27 Applicants and Other Stakeholders:</strong> For questions regarding the FY27 Program and Application, contact MEA at <a href=\"mailto:transportation.mea@maryland.gov\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"9aeee8fbf4e9eaf5e8eefbeef3f5f4b4f7fffbdaf7fbe8e3f6fbf4feb4fdf5ec\">[email protected]</span></a> or by phone at 443-826-7732</li><li><strong>FY24, FY25 and FY26 Grantees:</strong> For questions regarding a Grant Agreement, Grant Reporting, Invoicing, Extension Request, Close Out, Ribbon Cutting, or other inquiries, contact MEA at <a href=\"mailto:transportation.mea@maryland.gov\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"fa8e889b94898a95888e9b8e939594d4979f9bba979b8883969b949ed49d958c\">[email protected]</span></a> or by phone at 443-695-8356.​<br/></li></ul></div></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.94962;margin:0pt 5.18707pt 0pt 0.648003pt;text-indent:0.815994pt;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:12pt;vertical-align:baseline;\">Follow MEA on social media for updates: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/maryland_energy_administration/\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a> I  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:12pt;color:#c8122c;vertical-align:baseline;\">Facebook </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:12pt;vertical-align:baseline;\">I </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:12pt;color:#c8122c;vertical-align:baseline;\">Twitter  </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:12pt;vertical-align:baseline;\">I </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;font-size:12pt;color:#c8122c;vertical-align:baseline;\">Linkedin ​</span></p></span></div></div>\n</section>",
